			<item><link target="src-app-src-app-solid-codemirror-fileeditor-tsx" link="/src/app/solid/codemirror/FileEditor.tsx"><text title="src/app/solid/codemirror/FileEditor.tsx" code>FileEditor.tsx</></>: the component, and its props</>
			<item><link target="src-app-src-app-ui-codemirror-filestates-ts" link="/src/app/ui/codemirror/FileStates.ts"><text title="src/app/ui/codemirror/FileStates.ts" code>FileStates.ts</></>: a CodeMirror state per file, kept in step with it</>
			<item><link target="src-app-src-app-solid-lazycodemirror-tsx" link="/src/app/solid/LazyCodeMirror.tsx"><text title="src/app/solid/LazyCodeMirror.tsx" code>LazyCodeMirror.tsx</></>: loads it once the program has run</>
			<item><link target="src-tests-app-src-solid-inputeditor-browser-test-tsx" link="/tests/app/solid/InputEditor.browser.test.tsx"><text title="tests/app/solid/InputEditor.browser.test.tsx" code>InputEditor.browser.test.tsx</></>: its tests, through the input editor</>
			<item>In the app's CodeMirror editors: <link target="src-app-src-app-solid-codemirror" link="/src/app/solid/codemirror/"><text title="src/app/solid/codemirror/" code>solid/codemirror</></></>
		</>
	</>
